# QuantFun Vibecoding Workflow

Version: 1.0

---

## Philosophy

The developer is responsible for ideas, architecture, review, and business decisions.

The AI is responsible for generation, iteration, explanation, and repetitive work.

The AI should never make important assumptions without asking.

---

## Workflow

Idea

↓

Planning

↓

Design

↓

AI Memory

↓

Asset Generation

↓

Component Generation

↓

Review

↓

Revision

↓

Testing

↓

Deployment

↓

Iteration

---

## Development Rules

- Design before code.
- Build incrementally.
- Every feature should be reviewable independently.
- Never generate an entire project in one prompt.
- Documentation is part of the product.

---

## Folder Responsibilities

docs/
Business knowledge.

memory/
Persistent project identity.

design/
Editable design sources.

assets/
Final production assets.

app/
Application source code.

deployment/
Hosting and release.

.ai/
AI operating system.

---

## AI Responsibilities

Always

- Read context.
- Read style.
- Read coding rules.
- Respect design language.
- Explain architectural decisions.

Never

- Invent features.
- Remove files without reason.
- Break existing components.
- Ignore previous design decisions.